w, then back in and it shows the \"Files have been modified outside Godot\". Then I click \"Reload from disk\". Then I click outside godot window and back to godot window. Then the dialog pops up again \"Files have been modified outside Godot\" for the same file. This happens in a forever loop. \n\nThis did not happen in Godot 4.4 Beta 1. \n\nRestarting whole godot makes it go away, but the moment I modify a .gd file again outside godot, the problem occurss again.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628904282/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628968060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102234#issuecomment-2628968060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102234","id":2628968060,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cst58","user":{"login":"giokhmaladze","id":7861548,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NjE1NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7861548?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze","html_url":"https://github.com/giokhmaladze","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-01T14:10:24Z","updated_at":"2025-02-01T14:45:21Z","body":"Don't think this is related only to GDScript but any file.\n\nThis only happens, if the file was modified externally while it was also open in Godot's script editor. (You don't have to be on `Script` tab you could switch to any other tab as long as file is open there)\n\nAlso it doesn't matter if external editor is connected to language server and Godot and external editor doesn't need to be both visible to reproduce it.\n\nPrompt is also triggered when you are stopping running project, and sometimes it prevents you from stopping running project (you have to click stop button and close prompt dialog several times to stop the project, couldn't find exact way to reproduce it but it sometimes it happens)\n\nBut If you edit file externally while project was running, prompt won't appear (when changing window focus) until you stop running the project, then it starts appearing again","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628968060/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628983354","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102234#issuecomment-2628983354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102234","id":2628983354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6csxo6","user":{"login":"giokhmaladze","id":7861548,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NjE1NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7861548?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze","html_url":"https://github.com/giokhmaladze","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/following{/other_user}