mputer and the problem is back.\n\nThe bug happens with:\n`Godot v4.4.beta3.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.12033.1030) - AMD Ryzen 7 7735HS with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)`\n\nThe main difference with these computers is the Windows version. Bug doesn't happen with my Win 10 computer but it does happen with Win 11 computer. The external editor I use is the latest version of vscode.\n\nI deleted `.godot` folder, it didn't help.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652941765/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]